			"notes": "## LAN+ 2.2.5\n\n### New\n\n- 3D cosmetics: cosmetics shop with equippable slots and an XP economy (Yeah accessories are gonna be SLOW to made so please be patient).\n- Simple Voice Chat integration.\n- Skin library: save multiple skins per account.\n- Changeable IP domain: reroll your domain from Settings -> Advanced (7-day cooldown).\n- \"Friends of friends\" access mode + friend suggestions (mutual friends).\n- A better looking announcements (this is just for me).\n\n### Changes\n\n- Color picker with H/S/V sliders and a reorganized Theme tab.\n- LAN+ panel on the title screen.\n- Clearer access modes: *Everyone* now lets anyone join by the IP address (including players without the mod).\n- Leaving a hosted world now returns you to the title screen (instead of the multiplayer list).\n- Social links on the About section located in Settings.\n- And change of UI.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fixed legitimate players being rejected when joining *Everyone*-mode worlds by IP.\n- Responsive layout fix."
		},
