			"notes": "# Lan+ is now avaliable for fabric 1.20.1\n\n## Fixed\n- Your friends were getting displayed in other users Profiles.\n\n## Changes\n- Now you can host from the Pause Menu.\n- \"Host a world\" now works as a regular \"Open to LAN\"\n\n## Added\n- Now you can invite friends by right clicking their names (In Friends Section) or opening a Host and invite them from there.\n- A report section for profiles. If you see something that is wrong (which probably is) you can report it and a Maintainer will be take care of it. \n\n### Note from the Dev\n\nThe next update will focus on completely changing the mod's appearance, as well as starting to create the animation system for cosmetics. If you have any questions, issues, or just curious, you can check out my [GitHub](https://github.com/BgameXL/LanPlus) in case of any problems, or stop by my [Discord](https://discord.gg/kAKk3wRAVh)."
